  "notes": "Slate/Tailwind dark theme (slate-950 page, slate-900 sidebar, slate-800 assistant cards) with blue-500 user bubbles. Cat-mascot avatars (orange cat for the assistant, gray cat for the user) give the site its character. Assistant replies sit in rounded cards topped by an eye-icon 'Hide/Show thinking' toggle that reveals a monospace reasoning summary, then a divider rule. Code blocks have a 'TSX' language header and a Copy button, with One Dark highlighting. The composer is a wide pill-like rounded box (16px radius) with kbd-style hints below (↵ send, Shift ↵ new line, Tab complete, ↑ ↓ history). The send button is hidden/disabled while the box is empty. The sidebar's recent chats are truncated titles with timestamps, plus a 'Load more chats' link."
